#: scenario3:scenario3_C36D05BF_1019_4FD0_A1BE_592FC25DA236
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6b55fccc6895142ff9323b117c0765be4745daf28482637ff9336502c25ecae
