msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and when I go to bring it out to the guest, my heart about leaps out of my mouth. Guess why."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫손님 앞에 대령하기 전에 ⟪k:1⟫조졌단 걸 깨달았지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이유가 뭐일 것 같아?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_46EBE330_AB6F_4F2A_9199_BB4397AA1818
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f33af0473b879c4247b6fc1a0f5c2fd67e9edfefbbb2fb6aa2e4fd7e395922a
