msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What I ⟪k:2⟫thought⟪k:3⟫ was a plate was actually an ashtray!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Maaaan, I was "
"sweatin’ like a pig."
