msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The guest didn’t seem to notice, but the other maids were pale as ghosts the entire time. "
"⟪k:1⟫Just about everyone had themselves a case of the vapors."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫손님은 못 알아챘나 본데, ⟪k:1⟫메이드들은 핏기가 싹 가셨어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫싹 다 긴장했지."

